{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>They bore</b> — young men to grind [טחון], and טחון would be a noun of action [שם הפועל], like נלאיתי נשוא (Isaiah 1:14), and the strength of the youths failed in setting the mill-stick in motion [בהניע עץ הטחנה]. And some say it is as it sounds [כמשמעו], and the meaning is that every camp needs to grind and to gather wood [לטחון ולעצים]."], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:14.256642651Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}